## Problem classes

### `Shizuku installed but state stays not-installed`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Shevery is on the device and B-LAN says install Shizuku | Detector only checked `moe.shizuku.privileged.api` | Use the known-package list, then the permission / provider / receiver scan. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `pm grant WRITE_SECURE_SETTINGS still returns no PSK`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Grant succeeds and the passphrase is null | That permission is not the Wi-Fi secret capability | Call the privileged WifiManager methods on the Shizuku binder. Android 11+ shell uid is what can see them. |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Shizuku permission is granted and the PSK is still null`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `getPrivilegedConnectedNetwork` returns null in the app process, or the user-service bind always times out | Hidden WifiManager getters only answer the shell uid. A wait posted onto the main looper never sees `onServiceConnected`, because that callback needs the same looper | Run the getters inside a Shizuku user service. Wait for the bind on a worker thread. Unbind when the read finishes and on dispose, even if binder listeners were never registered |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `One failed consent dialog never asks again`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| The allow/deny sheet never appeared, and later attempts skip it | A missing activity was completed as an explicit No and persisted | Return a channel error when the dialog is not shown. Persist only Allow and Not now |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `User-service PSK read is always empty`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Shizuku is ready and the connected SSID is known, but the privileged read returns no passphrase | The user-service process has no `Context` (`ActivityThread.currentApplication` is often null), so WifiManager was never obtained | Give the user-service a `Context` constructor. Do not rely on `currentApplication` alone |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `IWifiManager rejects the app package`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `Package <app> does not belong to 2000`, or attributionSource is null | Hidden wifi binder calls were made with the app package / uid, or with an empty extras Bundle | Pass shell identity: user `"shell"`, package `"com.android.shell"`, AttributionSource uid 2000 in extras. Do not pass the app package |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-10 -->

### `Joiner Shizuku grant does not exist`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| PSK share works on the host, but the joiner cannot privileged-connect | Shizuku permission is per device. The host grant does not apply on the joiner | Require ready Shizuku on the joiner for silent STA switch. If missing, fall through to the system Wi-Fi panel |

